{"id": 38, "ts": 1780469674.8341548, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate the new detail on Candidate\u202fA\u2019s technical and cognitive abilities \u2013 his capacity to see complex connections, excellent spatial vision, and the ability to anticipate dangerous situations are clear strengths for a long\u2011distance pilot. However, the same record flags that A can be unorganized and is not good at taking criticism, and we still have no evidence of his stress\u2011resilience or crew\u2011cooperation under pressure. Compared with Candidate\u202fB, who demonstrates solid reliability (very conscientious), proven stress handling, and strong technical competence in weather assessment and computer systems, A\u2019s gaps in reliability and feedback orientation remain significant. Therefore, I continue to support **Candidate\u202fB** as the provisional hire, while recognizing A as a technically strong but less reliable alternative."}
